  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon avocado oil, or more as needed",
    "0.5 medium onion, finely chopped",
    "2 large cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 cup long-grain rice",
    "1.5 cups low-sodium chicken stock",
    "0.5 cup tomato sauce",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Turn on a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot); select sauté function and adjust to medium.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the bottom of the pot with avocado oil. Cook and stir onion until soft, 4 to 5 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, about 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1ePRhC4bGwlia9Ue_2-jmnQTXcw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263330-instant-pot-mexican-rice-step1-117copy-0794dbde734d4cb894a08f75227c9cfc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263330/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add rice to the pot; mix until coated with oil and lightly browned.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P41SYxOORKj60UTFKVeYI9cSuGY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263330-instant-pot-mexican-rice-step2-120copy-60412f3a3cba43b494ddbe61b413828f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263330/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in chicken stock; stir any browned bits off the bottom of the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6cwKCgguYzsWnMX16jh9EMY52G0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263330-instant-pot-mexican-rice-step3-122copy-4f6ed4b99c90479e8793fbc18a67b953.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263330/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in tomato sauce, salt, cumin, and cayenne pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pf_Evs3cL5b7_2ZyMBn2k5HALsk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263330-instant-pot-mexican-rice-step4-125copy-0e845530364a4fc784e18badc2de3797.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263330/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Close and lock the lid. Seal the vent and select high-pressure function. Set a timer for 7 minutes; allow 10 to 15 minutes for pressure to build.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Release pressure carefully using the quick-release method according to the manufacturer's instructions, about 5 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid. Stir rice before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
